[b]Drag and drop techs in your research queue to reorder them. A tech's prerequisites move with it, so the queue stays in a valid order.[/b]

Here it is in action:

[img]https://i.imgur.com/gr5cjiT.gif[/img]


[h2]Compatibility[/h2]
[list]
[*][b]Tested with 1.15.[/b]
[*][b]Achievement compatible.[/b]
[*][b]Save-safe.[/b] Add or remove it mid-campaign; it stores nothing in your save.
[*][b]Single-player.[/b] Untested in multiplayer.
[*][b]All eleven languages Victoria 3 ships.[/b]
[*][b]Tech mods:[/b] Likely won't work well. Techs added by another mod can be dragged down the queue, not up, and the arrow button ignores them.
[/list]

[h2]My other mods[/h2]
[list]
[*][url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3814823352][b][u]Smart Treaties[/u][/b][/url]: see what each goods transfer earns or costs you before you sign, and the 5 most profitable deals you could propose.
[*][url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3803950977][b][u]Build All[/u][/b][/url]: one click to queue a building in every state that can take it. Life changing for electrification.
[*][url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3799284646][b][u]Smart Notifications[/u][/b][/url]: get notified only about the countries that matter to you (EU4 watchlist in Victoria 3).
[/list]

